  "html_content": "<p>Here is a function:</p><pre><code class=\"language-ts\">function add(a: number, b: number): number {\n  return a &lt; b ? b + a : a + b; // &amp;&amp; done\n}\n</code></pre><p>And a table:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th colspan=\"2\">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>alpha</td><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>beta</td><td colspan=\"x\">3</td><td>4</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Inline <code>x &lt;= y</code> and <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>C</kbd>.</p>"
